        "### Step 2 — Normalisation\n",
        "\n",
        "Normalisation makes the vocabulary smaller and cleaner:\n",
        "- **Lowercasing**: `\"The\"` and `\"the\"` become the same word\n",
        "- **Punctuation removal**: strip `!`, `,`, `.` etc.\n",
        "- **Contraction expansion**: `\"don't\"` → `\"do not\"` (so tokenisation is consistent)\n",
        "\n",
        "⚠️ *Warning*: lowercasing can occasionally lose information — `\"Apple\"` (company) ≠ `\"apple\"` (fruit).\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "431a6967"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0d3b8346",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# ── Step 2: Normalisation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
        "CONTRACTIONS = {\n",
        "    \"don't\": \"do not\", \"can't\": \"cannot\", \"won't\": \"will not\",\n",
        "    \"it's\": \"it is\",   \"i'm\":  \"i am\",   \"you're\": \"you are\",\n",
        "    \"they're\": \"they are\", \"we're\": \"we are\", \"isn't\": \"is not\",\n",
        "    \"aren't\": \"are not\",  \"wasn't\": \"was not\", \"weren't\": \"were not\",\n",
        "    \"hasn't\": \"has not\",  \"haven't\": \"have not\", \"hadn't\": \"had not\",\n",
        "    \"doesn't\": \"does not\",\"didn't\": \"did not\",  \"wouldn't\": \"would not\",\n",
        "    \"shouldn't\": \"should not\", \"couldn't\": \"could not\", \"that's\": \"that is\",\n",
        "    \"there's\": \"there is\", \"i've\": \"i have\", \"i'd\": \"i would\",\n",
        "    \"i'll\": \"i will\", \"let's\": \"let us\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "def expand_contractions(text):\n",
        "    for contraction, expansion in CONTRACTIONS.items():\n",
        "        text = re.sub(re.escape(contraction), expansion, text, flags=re.IGNORECASE)\n",
        "    return text\n",
        "\n",
        "def normalise(text):\n",
        "    text = text.lower()                          # lowercase\n",
        "    text = expand_contractions(text)             # expand contractions\n",
        "    text = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', text)         # remove HTML tags\n",
        "    text = re.sub(r'[^a-z\\s]', ' ', text)       # remove non-alpha chars\n",
        "    text = re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', text).strip()    # collapse whitespace\n",
        "    return text\n",
        "\n",
        "# ── Test it ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
        "test_sentence = \"HELLO!!! The QuICK Brown Fox Jumps!!!! They're amazing, don't you think? <br>\"\n",
        "print(\"BEFORE:\", test_sentence)\n",
        "print(\"AFTER: \", normalise(test_sentence))\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "trusted": true,
        "execution": {
