        "### 4.3 — Laplace (Add-1) Smoothing\n",
        "\n",
        "**The Problem:** A single unseen bigram makes the entire sentence probability collapse to zero.\n",
        "\n",
        "$$P(\\text{\"the cat flew\"}) = 1.0 \\times 0.67 \\times 0 = 0 \\quad \\text{(disaster!)}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "**The Fix — Laplace Smoothing:**\n",
        "\n",
        "$$P_{\\text{smooth}}(w_2 \\mid w_1) = \\frac{\\text{count}(w_1, w_2) + 1}{\\text{count}(w_1) + |V|}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "where $|V|$ is the vocabulary size. Now **no probability is ever zero**.\n",
        "\n",
        "> 🏆 **TODO 6 (10 points)** — Implement `smoothed_bigram_prob()` and `sentence_perplexity()`.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "21040541"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "653e60d6",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# ── TODO 6a: Laplace smoothed bigram probability ─────────────────────────────\n",
        "# SCORING: 5 points\n",
        "\n",
        "def smoothed_bigram_prob(w2, w1, bigram_counts, unigram_counts, vocab_size):\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    Returns the Laplace-smoothed bigram probability P(w2 | w1).\n",
        "    Formula: (count(w1,w2) + 1) / (count(w1) + V)\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    count_w1_w2=bigram_counts[(w1, w2)]\n",
        "    count_w1=unigram_counts[w1]\n",
        "    return (count_w1_w2 + 1) / (count_w1 + vocab_size)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# ── Demonstrate that unseen bigrams are no longer zero ────────────────────────\n",
        "pairs = [(\"film\", \"great\"),    # likely seen\n",
        "         (\"movie\", \"purple\"),  # unlikely\n",
        "         (\"the\", \"cat\"),       # common\n",
        "         (\"zxqrt\", \"film\")]    # completely unseen word\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Smoothed bigram probabilities:\")\n",
        "for w2, w1 in pairs:\n",
        "    p = smoothed_bigram_prob(w2, w1, bigram_counts, unigram_counts, V)\n",
        "    print(f\"  P({w2!r:12} | {w1!r:12}) = {p:.6f}\")\n"
      ],
