        "---\n",
        "## Section 7 — Modern NLP with Hugging Face Transformers\n",
        "\n",
        "### What is a Transformer?\n",
        "\n",
        "The Transformer (2017, \"Attention is All You Need\") is the architecture behind BERT, GPT, and ChatGPT.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Key components:**\n",
        "- **Self-attention**: every word looks at every other word simultaneously — captures both local and long-range dependencies\n",
        "- **Multi-head attention**: multiple attention computations in parallel, each learning different relationships\n",
        "- **Positional encoding**: adds position information (since attention has no built-in sense of order)\n",
        "- **Stack of layers**: typically 12–96 transformer layers\n",
        "\n",
        "### Pre-training + Fine-tuning\n",
        "\n",
        "| Stage | What happens | Cost |\n",
        "|-------|-------------|------|\n",
        "| **Pre-training** | Train on 500 GB+ of internet text — learns grammar, facts, world knowledge | Very expensive (GPT-3 cost ~$4.6M) |\n",
        "| **Fine-tuning** | Train further on your small labelled dataset | Cheap — can run on a laptop |\n",
        "\n",
        "> You don't need to pre-train — you download a pre-trained model and fine-tune it for your task.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "daf66a18"
      }
    },
