        "### 8.2 — Precision, Recall, F1 (Manual Calculation)\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Precision** = $\\frac{TP}{TP + FP}$  — of predicted positives, how many are actually positive?  \n",
        "> **Recall** = $\\frac{TP}{TP + FN}$  — of actual positives, how many did we catch?  \n",
        "> **F1** = $\\frac{2 \\times P \\times R}{P + R}$  — harmonic mean of Precision and Recall\n",
        "\n",
        "> 🏆 **TODO 14 (5 points)** — Compute TP, FP, FN, TN manually from predictions. Then compute Precision, Recall, and F1.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "08ecd0b1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "95488752",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# ── TODO 14: Manual Precision, Recall, F1 ───────────────────────────────────\n",
        "# SCORING: 5 points\n",
        "\n",
        "# Get predictions from your from-scratch Naïve Bayes on the test set\n",
        "y_pred_scratch = nb_scratch.predict(list(X_test))\n",
        "y_true_list    = list(y_test)\n",
        "\n",
        "# TODO: Count TP, FP, FN, TN (treating 'positive' as the positive class)\n",
        "TP = 0  # predicted positive AND truly positive\n",
        "FP = 0  # predicted positive BUT truly negative\n",
        "FN = 0  # predicted negative BUT truly positive\n",
        "TN = 0  # predicted negative AND truly negative\n",
        "\n",
        "for true, pred in zip(y_true_list, y_pred_scratch):\n",
        "    if true == 'positive' and pred == 'positive':\n",
        "        TP += 1\n",
        "    elif true == 'negative' and pred == 'positive':\n",
        "        FP += 1\n",
        "    elif true == 'positive' and pred == 'negative':\n",
        "        FN += 1\n",
        "    elif true == 'negative' and pred == 'negative':\n",
        "        TN += 1\n",
        "\n",
        "# TODO: Compute Precision, Recall, F1\n",
        "precision = TP / (TP + FP) if (TP + FP) > 0 else 0.0  # ← formula above\n",
        "recall    = TP / (TP + FN) if (TP + FN) > 0 else 0.0  # ← formula above\n",
        "f1        = (2 * precision * recall) / (precision + recall) if (precision + recall) > 0 else 0.0  # ← formula above\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"TP = {TP},  FP = {FP},  FN = {FN},  TN = {TN}\")\n",
        "print(f\"\\nPrecision : {precision:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Recall    : {recall:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"F1 Score  : {f1:.4f}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# ── Verify against sklearn ───────────────────────────────────────\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics import precision_score, recall_score, f1_score\n",
        "print(f\"\\n✅ sklearn F1 (verify): {f1_score(y_true_list, y_pred_scratch, pos_label='positive'):.4f}\")"
